evovpeg: static video and audio decoders and a stream prober for the evo framework
(https://evoframework.org). It reads local media and writes raw video frames or audio
PCM to stdout and encodes H.264/AAC for Outcast; its prober reports stream properties.
It supports local files, pipes and HTTP/HTTPS. Device capture/output modules are disabled;
ARM builds retain the V4L2 M2M decoders, which require compatible device drivers.
The recipe is public at https://github.com/foonerd/evovpeg; the build.json beside this
file names the exact sources, digests and configure set.

